  (text "Notes\nU3: STM32H563VIT6 is pin-compatible\nC20: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included\nC21: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included\nC22: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included\nC23: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included\nC24: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included\nC25: one per VDD pin, VDDUSB included"
    (at 15.24 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid e3f3288f-8113-5a5d-a9c1-d33999eb0295)
  )
  (text "\nFB1: VDDA / VREF+ filter\nC29: VCAP, CHECK value and count against the H5 datasheet\nY1: HSE, CL 10 pF class. CHECK against the DK\nC31: CHECK for the crystal's CL\nY2: CL 6 pF, ESR per AN2867\nC33: AN2867, CHECK for the crystal\nJP1: fit a jumper for the ST bootloader"
    (at 203.2 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a9eb5f03-4fe2-522c-be71-7e1203ab17e0)
  )
  (text "\nJ6: FTDI TTL-232R-3V3 order: 1 GND, 2 CTS, 3 VCC (not connected), 4 cable TXD, 5 cable RXD, 6 RTS\nR23: hardware revision 0: both pulled down\nR25: NOT FITTED.\nR26: NOT FITTED.\nJ7: shunt with pull tab; silkscreen 1-2 CORE / 2-3 I/O NODE / none = OFF; reachable only with the housing open\nC36: ESD, at J7"
    (at 391.16 347.98 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 566ead6b-7ae9-562d-a3b5-d1938bdbe90c)
  )

